+//   MMC1   [0] control  [1] CHR 0  [2] CHR 1  [3] PRG  [4] shift value  [5] shift count
+//   MMC2   [0..3] CHR $FD/0, $FE/0, $FD/1, $FE/1  [4] PRG  [5] mirroring  [6] latch 0  [7] latch 1
+//   MMC3   [0..7] R0-R7  [8] bank select  [9] $A000  [10] $A001  [11] IRQ latch
